      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Synchronous 200/201 responses can return immediately; use the documented result for that API. A successful provisioning\noperation does not prove that snapshotting has completed, that all tables are current, or that the SQL analytics endpoint has\ncaught up.",
      "originalText": "Synchronous 200/201 responses can return immediately; use the documented result for that API. A successful provisioning operation does not prove that snapshotting has completed, that all tables are current, or that the SQL analytics endpoint has caught up.",
